<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀζᾰλέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dry, parched</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.491
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.234
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῶν ἀζαλέην</span>
			<i>dry</i> bull's-hide, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				7.239
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γῆρας</span>”
				<i>withered, sapless,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					14.1389
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				 i 12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.789c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>harsh, cruel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.237
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>parching, scorching</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σείριος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					153
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.679
			</span></i>; of love, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ibyc.
					1.9
				</span></i>
			; of thirst, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				339
			</span></i>.—Poet. word. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀζαλέα</span></b> , ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίλωθρον</span>
			, <u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
